，用稱不替代即位年份；死亡或被虜不自動推所有稱號終止。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p029","text":"而漢使者往既多，其少從率多進熟於天子，言曰：「宛有善馬在貳師城，匿不肯與漢使。」天子既好宛馬，聞之甘心，使壯士車令等持千金及金馬以請宛王貳師城善馬。宛國饒漢物，相與謀曰：「漢去我遠，而鹽水中數敗，出其北有胡寇，出其南乏水草。又且往往而絕邑，乏食者多。漢使數百人為輩來，而常乏食，死者過半，是安能致大軍乎？無柰我何。且貳師馬，宛寶馬也。」遂不肯予漢使。漢使怒，妄言，椎金馬而去。宛貴人怒曰：「漢使至輕我！」遣漢使去，令其東邊郁成遮攻殺漢使，取其財物。於是天子大怒。諸嘗使宛姚定漢等言宛兵弱，誠以漢兵不過三千人，彊弩射之，即盡虜破宛矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"車令","kind":"person","person_id":"l7y_ed2_wom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"宛王","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0188","start":188,"end":191,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0235","start":235,"end":238,"surface":"姚定漢","kind":"person","person_id":"pbn_4mh_7ix","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","book_id":"b-shiji-123","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p032","text":"其夏，漢亡浞野之兵二萬餘於匈奴。公卿及議者皆願罷擊宛軍，專力攻胡。天子已業誅宛，宛小國而不能下，則大夏之屬輕漢，而宛善馬絕不來，烏孫、侖頭易苦漢使矣，為外國笑。乃案言伐宛尤不便者鄧光等，赦囚徒材官，益發惡少年及邊騎，歲餘而出敦煌者六萬人，負私從者不與。牛十萬，馬三萬餘匹，驢騾橐它以萬數。多齎糧，兵弩甚設，天下騷動，傳相奉伐宛，凡五十餘校尉。宛王城中無井，皆汲城外流水，於是乃遣水工徙其城下水空以空其城。益發戍甲卒十八萬，酒泉、張掖北，置居延、休屠以衛酒泉，而發天下七科適，及載糒給貳師。轉車人徒相連屬至敦煌。而拜習馬者二人為執驅校尉，備破宛擇取其善馬云。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"浞野","kind":"person","person_id":"z0l_1wp_de1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"鄧光","kind":"person","person_id":"o5r_zwu_65v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"宛王","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0257","start":257,"end":262,"surface":"習馬者二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","book_id":"b-shiji-123","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p033","text":"於是貳師后復行，兵多，而所至小國莫不迎，出食給軍。至侖頭，侖頭不下，攻數日，屠之。自此而西，平行至宛城，漢兵到者三萬人。宛兵迎擊漢兵，漢兵射敗之，宛走入葆乘其城。貳師兵欲行攻郁成，恐留行而令宛益生詐，乃先至宛，決其水源，移之，則宛固已憂困。圍其城，攻之四十餘日，其外城壞，虜宛貴人勇將煎靡。宛大恐，走入中城。宛貴人相與謀曰：「漢所為攻宛，以王毋寡匿善馬而殺漢使。今殺王毋寡而出善馬，漢兵宜解；即不解，乃力戰而死，未晚也。」宛貴人皆以為然，共殺其王毋寡，持其頭遣貴人使貳師，約曰：「漢毋攻我。我盡出善馬，恣所取，而給漢軍食。即不聽，我盡殺善馬，而康居之救且至。至，我居內，康居居外，與漢軍戰。漢軍熟計之，何從？」是時康居候視漢兵，漢兵尚盛，不敢進。貳師與趙始成、李哆等計：「聞宛城中新得秦人，知穿井，而其內食尚多。所為來，誅首惡者毋寡。毋寡頭已至，如此而不許解兵，則堅守，而康居候漢罷而來救宛，破漢軍必矣。」軍吏皆以為然，許宛之約。宛乃出其善馬，令漢自擇之，而多出食食給漢軍。漢軍取其善馬數十匹。中馬以下牡牝三千餘匹，而立宛貴人之故待遇漢使善者名昧蔡以為宛王，與盟而罷兵。終不得入中城。乃罷而引歸。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0137","start":137,"end":140,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"煎靡","kind":"person","person_id":"ral_28k_rwc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0154","start":154,"end":157,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0211","start":211,"end":214,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0223","start":223,"end":225,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0323","start":323,"end":325,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0326","start":326,"end":329,"surface":"趙始成","kind":"person","person_id":"zpc_ufe_fc2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0330","start":330,"end":332,"surface":"李哆","kind":"person","person_id":"ey5_6f2_7to","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0342","start":342,"end":344,"surface":"秦人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0364","start":364,"end":366,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0367","start":367,"end":369,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0460","start":460,"end":463,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0472","start":472,"end":474,"surface":"昧蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ivv_l99_uev","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","book_id":"b-shiji-123","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p036","text":"漢已伐宛，立昧蔡為宛王而去。歲餘，宛貴人以為昧蔡善諛，使我國遇屠，乃相與殺昧蔡，立毋寡昆弟曰蟬封為宛王，而遣其子入質於漢。漢因使使賂賜以鎮撫之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m036-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"昧蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ivv_l99_uev","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m036-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"昧蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ivv_l99_uev","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m036-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"昧蔡","kind":"person","person_id":"ivv_l99_uev","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m036-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m036-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"蟬封","kind":"person","person_id":"h4f_d5f_vdl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m036-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"其子","kind":"person","person_id":"h4f_d5f_vdl_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","book_id":"b-shiji-123","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-123","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan","source":{"title":"史記／卷123","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷123","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷123&oldid=8736799","revision_id":8736799,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定修訂全文39段，包括末段索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY